{"unit_id":"Electricitysheep__dsh-tool-turbo#feature-effort-policy","repo":"Electricitysheep/dsh-tool-turbo","commit":"d29e7d9d73032516e37797ea69592ce18e0fe05f","type":"feature","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tool-turbo 的推理力度策略：读取当前步骤最近的工具调用，以简单工具比例和参数大小选择 low、high 或 max。它在 agent/request 请求瀑布流中为下一次模型请求注入决定；升级和降级受配置开关控制。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/effort-decision.ts:51-69","src/index.ts:59-69"]}
